# J_geo (TravExplorer eq. 15-16) between points on the support graph of the current floor
# (voxel_mapper_node, trav3d.FloorGraph). Points are snapped to the nearest M_trav voxel.
geometry_msgs/Point[] sources
geometry_msgs/Point[] targets
---
# row-major [len(sources) x len(targets)]; inf where there is no path or no M_trav voxel near
float64[] costs
bool ok          # false: no map / graph yet
